'''Skulls''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 14th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is black with three red skulls facing different directions surrounded by a red aura, hence the name. The guard is red, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

